### What You've Achieved

From `fn greet()` in L1-01 to this 8-function showcase, you've learned:
- **Functions with parameters** — passing data in
- **Return values** — getting data out
- **Boolean logic** — true/false decisions
- **Loops in functions** — repeating work
- **Function composition** — building from parts
- **String manipulation** — text processing
- **Void functions** — performing actions
- **Orchestration** — main() as conductor

This is real programming. Every app you'll ever build follows this same pattern: specialized functions, cleanly orchestrated.

